' docs/04_uml/seq_quiz_anomaly.puml
@startuml
title Examory - Quiz attempt and anomaly review
actor Student
boundary Web
participant quizzes
queue Kafka
participant "ML anomaly" as Anomaly
participant grading
actor Teacher

note over Web, grading
  Authenticated APIs use Nginx (omitted).
  Events use the common envelope and payloads in docs/03_architecture/events.md.
end note
Student -> Web : Start quiz
Web -> quizzes : Create authorized Attempt and assign Variant
quizzes --> Web : attempt_id, variant_id, questions, time limit
quizzes -> Kafka : quiz.started
note right of Kafka
  Topic: lms.quizzes.
  Payload: attempt_id, quiz_id, variant_id,
  question_count, time_limit_sec, exam_session_id.
end note
Kafka -> Anomaly : quiz.started
loop Each saved answer or answer change
  Student -> Web : Answer Question
  Web -> quizzes : Save Answer for Attempt
  quizzes --> Web : Answer saved
  quizzes -> Kafka : quiz.answered
  note right of Kafka
    Topic: lms.quizzes.
    Payload: attempt_id, question_id, question_index,
    answer_hash, is_change, time_since_shown_ms,
    time_since_attempt_start_ms.
  end note
  Kafka -> Anomaly : quiz.answered
end
alt Student submits before timeout
  Student -> Web : Submit quiz
  Web -> quizzes : Finalize Attempt once
else Server-controlled time limit expires
  quizzes -> quizzes : Finalize Attempt once using saved Answers
end
quizzes --> Web : Accepted attempt_id and completion status
Web --> Student : Attempt submitted
quizzes -> Kafka : quiz.submitted
note right of Kafka
  Topic: lms.quizzes.
  Payload: attempt_id, quiz_id, variant_id, score,
  max_score, duration_ms, answers_changed.
end note
Kafka -> Anomaly : quiz.submitted
alt Anomaly evaluation reports a risk
  Anomaly -> Kafka : risk.behavior_anomaly
  note right of Anomaly
    Topic: ai.risk.
    Payload: risk_id, target_type = attempt,
    target_id = attempt_id, score, level,
    model {name, version}, explanation, evidence.
  end note
  Kafka -> grading : risk.behavior_anomaly
  grading -> grading : Store risk beside Attempt; status = pending
  Teacher -> Web : Inspect Attempt and risk
  Web -> grading : Read authorized risk evidence
  grading --> Web : Explanation, evidence and status
  Web --> Teacher : Show review controls
  Teacher -> Web : Confirm or dismiss with reason
  Web -> grading : Save Teacher review
  grading -> Kafka : risk.reviewed
  note right of grading
    Topic: lms.grades.
    Payload: risk_id, decision = confirmed | dismissed,
    reviewed_by, comment.
  end note
  grading --> Web : Review saved
else No risk or delayed/unavailable evaluation
  note over quizzes, grading
    Saved answers and submitted Attempt remain valid.
    No risk score automatically changes a grade or imposes a penalty.
  end note
end
@enduml
